    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Conduct awareness Programme on health, sanitation and pandemic management.
2. operationalized mobile medical unit.
3. upgradation of Anganwadis, computer labs and a Middle school. 
4. Solarization of Anganwadis and computer labs.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 12 session on awareness Programme related to health were conducted.
2. The mobile unit has been working in partnership with the civil surgeon office and it also helped the administration in pandemic management.
3. 4 computer labs 1 middle school along with the Anganwadis in the project area were upgraded. 
4 63 KW of solarise power was provided to Anganwadis and computer labs.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Conduct awareness programmes on health and sanitation for adolescent girls, pregnant and lactating mothers
2. Operationalise mobile medical unit (MMU)
3. Construct computer labs
4. Provide electric vehicles for Auxiliary Nurse Midwives</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Several awareness programmes on health and sanitation conducted 
2. 1 MMU operationlised 
3. Construction of computer labs is in progress
4. Electric vehicles provided for ANMs</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgradation of community infrastructure
Strengthening digital literacy</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">10 anganwadi and one community hall were upgraded in the project area
-24 desktop computers were provided to the schools to enhance the digital literacy</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
